<!--
  Auto Code — Gravicode Studios (Kang Fadhil)

  EN: classic .NET app.config support. Keys use the AutoCode: configuration path and are read at the
      lowest precedence, so anything in settings.json or an environment variable still wins. This
      exists so Auto Code can be dropped into an environment that already manages .NET apps this way.
  ID: dukungan app.config klasik. Kunci memakai jalur konfigurasi AutoCode: dan dibaca pada prioritas
      terendah, sehingga settings.json maupun environment variable tetap menang.

  Uncomment and edit to configure a provider without touching any JSON file.
-->
